3964313285523919107,DcEEe3qA9ED,https://www.instagram.com/reel/DcEEe3qA9ED/,reel,2026-08-15T14:11:21.000Z,296930,3200,18011491220747811,"Hon'ble Chief Minister Sir, MBBS interns in Uttar Pradesh work 24x7 in wards, emergency departments, labour rooms, ICUs, and rural health centres, yet receive only ₹12,000 per month. As internship stipends are being reviewed and increased across the country, we respectfully request the UP Government to revise the MBBS internship stipend to ₹30,000 per month. A fair stipend is not a privilege-it is recognition of the service and responsibility carried by future doctors. @cmoffice_up @upgovt @brajeshpathakup",2026-08-16T06:57:52.000Z,0,0,,0,shivanshsingh_05,Shivansh Singh Patel,35831371068,false,https://www.instagram.com/shivanshsingh_05/
