3962130802514507532,Db8UPj9grcM,https://www.instagram.com/reel/Db8UPj9grcM/,reel,2026-08-12T13:55:13.000Z,229206,4574,18123712357829850,"Happy independence Day .. vande Mataram is desh ki atma hai iske bol humesha humein desh ke liye qurbani dene ke liye protshahit karte hain ye bo bhavna hai jisne kabhi sadharan bharatiyon ko duniya ke sabse taakatvar samrajya se ladne ke shakti di the . Vande matram hamare swantantrata sangram ke pehli dhadkan hai . 1880 ke dashak me jab bankim Chandra chattopadhyay ji ne likha sujalam sufalam Malayaj Sheetalam to shayd unhein bhi yeh nahin pta tha ki yeh panktiyan kolkata ke galiyon se leker punjab ke kheton aur maharastra ke bagon tak goonjti hui ek din iss desh ke chetna ban jaayengi , ye bhi sach hai ki sufalam sufalam Malayaj Sheetalam ka jo adarsh vande mataram humein dikhata hai aaj wahi jal wahi dharti aur wahi hawa dhree dhree pradushan ke sankat se gujar rahi hai . Hamare swantantrata senaniyon ne desh ke liye sab kuch nyochhavar kar diya Aaj unka tyag humein yaad dilata hai ke deshbhakti keval itihas me nahin hamari dainik zimmedariyon me basti hai . By Krishna das ❤️",2026-08-14T19:28:13.000Z,1,0,,0,bramcharya_das,Krishna das❤️🌷,59713610695,false,https://www.instagram.com/bramcharya_das/
