3962130802514507532,Db8UPj9grcM,https://www.instagram.com/reel/Db8UPj9grcM/,reel,2026-08-12T13:55:13.000Z,229206,4574,17903183202500133,"Sir aapki sahi jgh kisi spiritual organization ya mandir mein theek nahi? But not as a politician. Yogi should be free from all this things. It's high time this govt. Introduce an exam for politicians to qualify for a desired spot. Well educated politicians is what we want. Who's only thoughts should be for growth of india/ a particular region in technology, science, infrastructure, education, health, crime control, removing corruption, better conditions of schools, proper syllabus in the books, relatable syllabus that actually helps, civic sense, no VIP rule on roads, no rallies at the time of vote, no poster advertisement at the time of voting, and much more to compete with other nations such as china, japan, america. But your thinking stops only at distribution in the name of caste, dharm, religion and what not. Please don't make my beautiful country go backward. Please don't make my people hate each other. Karma will punish all. We all are human first.",2026-08-13T08:31:24.000Z,0,0,,0,_s_akshi8,sakshi,15122633638,false,https://www.instagram.com/_s_akshi8/
